<main class="page">
<section class="wed-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow" data-revel-appear="fade">[[Nous nous marions||We're getting married]]</p><h1 data-revel-text="up split=chars">Alice &amp; Hugo</h1><p class="wed-hero__date" data-revel-appear="fade delay=0.6">[[19 juin 2027||June 19, 2027]]</p><img class="wed-hero__photo" src="@@hero:1200@@" alt="@@alt:hero@@" data-revel-appear="up delay=0.4 dur=1.2"></div></section>
<section class="section section--surface" id="[[programme||schedule]]"><div class="container"><x-use c="section-head" variant="center" eyebrow="[[Programme||Schedule]]" title="[[La journée||The day]]"></x-use><div class="timeline"><div class="moment" data-revel-appear="up"><p class="moment__time">15:00</p><div><h3>[[Cérémonie||Ceremony]]</h3><p>[[Sous les tilleuls, dans le jardin du domaine.||Under the linden trees, in the estate garden.]]</p></div></div><div class="moment" data-revel-appear="up"><p class="moment__time">17:00</p><div><h3>[[Vin d'honneur||Drinks]]</h3><p>[[Sur la terrasse, avec un quatuor à cordes.||On the terrace, with a string quartet.]]</p></div></div><div class="moment" data-revel-appear="up"><p class="moment__time">20:00</p><div><h3>[[Dîner||Dinner]]</h3><p>[[Dans la grange, place aux discours.||In the barn, time for speeches.]]</p></div></div><div class="moment" data-revel-appear="up"><p class="moment__time">23:00</p><div><h3>[[On danse !||Dancing!]]</h3><p>[[Jusqu'au bout de la nuit.||Until the early hours.]]</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="[[lieu||venue]]"><div class="container split"><div class="duo"><img src="@@venue:900@@" alt="@@alt:venue@@"><img src="@@flowers:900@@" alt="@@alt:flowers@@"></div><div class="stack"><p class="eyebrow">[[Lieu||Venue]]</p><h2>{{ site.address }}</h2><p class="lead">[[Le domaine est à 20 minutes de la gare de Valence. Une navette vous attend à 14 h 15.||The estate is 20 minutes from the station. A shuttle will be waiting at 2:15 pm.]]</p><p class="muted">[[Hébergements conseillés : chambres d'hôtes du village, réservées à notre nom jusqu'au 1er mai.||Recommended stays: village guest houses, held under our name until May 1.]]</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section section--surface" id="infos"><div class="container faqs"><x-use c="section-head" variant="center" eyebrow="[[Infos||Info]]" title="[[Bon à savoir||Good to know]]"></x-use><x-use c="faq" question="[[Y a-t-il un thème vestimentaire ?||Is there a dress code?]]"><p>[[Tenue de jardin chic, chaussures confortables pour la pelouse.||Garden chic, comfortable shoes for the lawn.]]</p></x-use><x-use c="faq" question="[[Les enfants sont-ils invités ?||Are children invited?]]"><p>[[Oui, un espace jeux et une baby-sitter les attendent.||Yes, a play area and a babysitter will be there.]]</p></x-use><x-use c="faq" question="[[Une liste de mariage ?||A gift registry?]]"><p>[[Votre présence suffit ! Une urne sera à disposition pour notre voyage.||Your presence is enough! A box will be there for our honeymoon.]]</p></x-use></div></section>
<section class="section" id="[[reponse||rsvp]]"><div class="container"><x-use c="section-head" variant="center" eyebrow="[[Réponse||RSVP]]" title="[[Serez-vous des nôtres ?||Will you join us?]]" text="[[Merci de répondre avant le 1er avril.||Please reply before April 1.]]"></x-use><form class="form form--narrow wed-form" data-revel-form="[[reponse||rsvp]]"><div class="form__row"><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[Nom||Name]]</span><input class="field__input" type="text" name="[[nom||name]]" required></label><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[E-mail||Email]]</span><input class="field__input" type="email" name="email" required></label></div><div class="form__row"><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[Présence||Attending]]</span><select class="field__input" name="[[presence||attending]]"><option>[[Avec joie||Joyfully yes]]</option><option>[[Avec regret, non||Sadly no]]</option></select></label><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[Nombre de personnes||Number of guests]]</span><input class="field__input" type="number" name="[[personnes||guests]]" min="1" max="6" value="2"></label></div><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[Allergies ou message||Allergies or message]]</span><textarea class="field__input" name="message" rows="3"></textarea></label><button class="btn" type="submit">[[Envoyer ma réponse||Send my reply]]</button><p class="form__status" data-revel-form-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></div></section>
</main>
